# Digital Libraries: An Overview.

**Authors:** Schwartz, Candy

## Abstract
Provides an overview of the basic components of a digital library. Highlights include library collections; metadata; services, including information seeking and retrieval, reference query fulfillment, and user training; user interaction with digital libraries, including searching, browsing, and navigation; economic support; maintenance; intellectual property rights; and evaluation. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ625139

